    "# Quiz: Introduction to Data Science in the Cloud\n",
    "\n",
    "> **On Alps:** These are the questions of this lesson's pre-lecture and post-lecture quizzes, from the course's quiz app, with the answers the quiz app accepts."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Pre-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-17-pre-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is the cloud?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>A collection of databases for storing big data.</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Databases are just one service. The cloud also offers storage, networking, software, analytics and more.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>A collection of pay-as-you-go computing services over the internet.</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. The cloud delivers a wide range of pay-as-you-go computing services over the internet.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>A visible mass of particles suspended in the air.</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. In computing, the cloud means pay-as-you-go computing services delivered over the internet.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-17-pre-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What is cloud computing?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Delivery of computing services over the internet.</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Cloud computing is the delivery of computing services over the internet.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Setting up your own datacenter.</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. With the cloud, you don't need to buy hardware or run your own datacenters.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Using the internet.</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The cloud uses the internet, but it means delivering computing services, like storage and software, over it.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-17-pre-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>What are some advantages of the cloud?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Flexibility, scalability, reliability, security</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Flexibility, scalability, reliability and security are all reasons people choose the cloud.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Flexibility, scalability, variability, security</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Variability is not among the cloud's benefits. Reliability is.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Clarity, scalability, reliability, variability</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Clarity and variability are not among the cloud's benefits.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## Post-lecture quiz"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-17-post-1\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Which one is NOT necessarily a good reason for choosing the cloud?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Using Machine Learning and data intelligence services</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Ready-made machine learning services are one way the cloud helps data scientists.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Processing large amounts of data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. The cloud's huge computing power is a good reason to process large amounts of data there.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Storing sensitive/confidential governmental data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Some groups have strict security rules and need full control of the equipment that holds their data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-17-post-2\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>In which way(s) do data scientists use the cloud?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Infrastructure tasks</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Cloud services can take care of infrastructure for you. Data scientists use the cloud for jobs like storing large amounts of data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Storing large amounts of data</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. Data scientists can store large amounts of data in the cloud instead of buying and managing big servers.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Configuring networking options</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. Cloud services can set up networks for you. Data scientists use the cloud for jobs like storing large amounts of data.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "raw",
   "metadata": {
    "format": "application/vnd.pretext+xml"
   },
   "source": [
    "<exercise label=\"dsb-quiz-17-post-3\">\n",
    "  <statement>\n",
    "    <p>Which cloud computing service provides access to software applications without the need to maintain the software?</p>\n",
    "  </statement>\n",
    "  <choices randomize=\"no\">\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Infrastructure as a Service</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. With IaaS you rent infrastructure, like servers and storage, not ready-made software.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice>\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Platform as a Service</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Not quite. With PaaS you rent a place to build and manage your own software.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "    <choice correct=\"yes\">\n",
    "      <statement>\n",
    "        <p>Software as a Service</p>\n",
    "      </statement>\n",
    "      <feedback>\n",
    "        <p>Correct. With SaaS you use software over the internet without hosting or maintaining it.</p>\n",
    "      </feedback>\n",
    "    </choice>\n",
    "  </choices>\n",
    "</exercise>"
   ]
  }
 ],
